  "legal_principles": [
    {
      "principle": "State intervention is only as a facilitator in the absence of a mandate that all Hindu marriages are to be necessarily registered.",
      "held": "Therefore, a conjoint reading of Section 8 and Rule 3 would imply that the intention was that whoever wanted to secure a certificate evidencing proof of his or her marriage, had to be facilitated the process in an appropriate and reasonable manner through rules.",
